Title: Summary Statistics for a Numeric Column
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Xinyue Ashley", "Zhang", , "xzhan151@student.ubc.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a function that calculates the mean, median, minimum and maximum of a numeric 
    column in a data frame and returns them together in a tibble. Supports grouped data frames and 
    optional removal of NA values. 
